    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30769" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Neptūnīnē</span></b> ,
			ēs, f.
		Neptunus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a daughter</i> or <i>granddaughter of
				Neptune</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tene Thetis tenuit pulcherrima Neptunine,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the daughter of Nereus, a son of Neptune</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					64, 28</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Prisc. p. 585</span></i> P.</div>
